  "code": "def factor_overnight_repricing_ewm_stability(df):\n    \"\"\"Measures recency-weighted leadership of overnight repricing over intraday returns.\"\"\"\n    df_copy = df.copy()\n    overnight_ret, intraday_ret = alpha_tools.decompose_overnight_intraday(df_copy[\"close\"], df_copy[\"open\"])\n    overnight_ewm = overnight_ret.ewm(span=63, min_periods=63, adjust=False).mean()\n    intraday_ewm = intraday_ret.ewm(span=63, min_periods=63, adjust=False).mean()\n    activity_ewm = (overnight_ret.abs() + intraday_ret.abs()).ewm(span=63, min_periods=63, adjust=False).mean().replace(0.0, np.nan)\n    df_copy[\"factor_overnight_repricing_ewm_stability\"] = (overnight_ewm - intraday_ewm) / activity_ewm\n    return df_copy[\"factor_overnight_repricing_ewm_stability\"]",
  "cross_sectional_rationale": "The bounded overnight-led phase measure remains most meaningful relative to contemporaneous stocks, where ranking distinguishes the strongest information-led repricing leadership while limiting market-wide variation in the overnight/intraday return mix.",
